# The root .gitignore ignores every *.json. For STEP 1 the JSON IS the deliverable,
# and a blanket rule like that has already silently dropped 64 result files from
# this repo once. Re-include the results explicitly.
!epoch_search.json
!epoch_results.json
!epoch_rows_search/*.json
!epoch_rows_results/*.json
# per-run logs embed local paths; smoke runs are insecure by design and never results
epoch_rows_*/*.log
epoch_smoke.json
epoch_rows_smoke/
